    "Dig In = 翻开家里蜂巢、把记忆捞出来。\n\n在线时，你搜一句话，它去电脑里的蜂巢找答案。\n\n离线时（家睡着了），它翻手边存过的本地缓存，先给你能给的，等家回来再补全。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dig In = open up the Hive at home and pull memories out.\n\nWhen online, you type a phrase and it goes to the Hive on your computer for an answer.\n\nWhen offline (home is asleep), it digs through the local cache on hand, gives you what it can for now, and fills in the rest once home is back."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dig In = 翻开家里蜂巢、把记忆捞出来。\n\n在线时，你搜一句话，它去电脑里的蜂巢找答案。\n\n离线时（家睡着了），它翻手边存过的本地缓存，先给你能给的，等家回来再补全。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
