    "一键掐断某个触角的投稿通道。断开后它送不进东西，需要时随时恢复，不影响其他触角。适合临时停用某个 AI 时用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One-tap shutdown of an antenna's submission channel. Once cut off it can't send anything in. Reconnect whenever you need — the others are unaffected. Handy for temporarily benching an AI."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一键掐断某个触角的投稿通道。断开后它送不进东西，需要时随时恢复，不影响其他触角。适合临时停用某个 AI 时用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
