    "个人、财务、关系、私事，四个加密仓库。存进来的敏感信息自动锁死加密，连你信任的 AI 触角都读不到，只有你在电脑端解锁后才能看。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Personal, Finance, Relationships, Private — four encrypted vaults. Anything sensitive stored there is locked and encrypted automatically. Not even the AI antennas you trust can read it; only you can, after unlocking on the computer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "个人、财务、关系、私事，四个加密仓库。存进来的敏感信息自动锁死加密，连你信任的 AI 触角都读不到，只有你在电脑端解锁后才能看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
