    "出门也能投喂回家 · 不存云端": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Feed your Hive from anywhere · nothing to the cloud"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出门也能投喂回家 · 不存云端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出门在外也能把记忆投喂回家。家里电脑开着 → 直接送回家；电脑关了 → 先存手机，回家开机自动送回家。全程不存云端，记忆始终在你自己的电脑里。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can send memories home even when you're out. Computer on → straight home. Computer off → saved on your phone first, then sent home automatically once it's back on. Nothing goes to the cloud at any point; your memories stay on your own computer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出门在外也能把记忆投喂回家。家里电脑开着 → 直接送回家；电脑关了 → 先存手机，回家开机自动送回家。全程不存云端，记忆始终在你自己的电脑里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
