    "手机": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Phone"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手机和电脑上的蜂巢连起来，你的念头才能存进电脑里的「家」。填电脑蜂巢的局域网地址（如 http://192.168.x.x:8768）和密钥（相当于家门钥匙），点「测试连接」看通不通。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once your phone and the Hive on your computer are connected, your thoughts can be stored into the \"home\" on your computer. Enter the LAN address of the Hive (e.g. http://192.168.x.x:8768) and the key (your front-door key), then tap Test connection to see if it gets through."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手机和电脑上的蜂巢连起来，你的念头才能存进电脑里的「家」。填电脑蜂巢的局域网地址（如 http://192.168.x.x:8768）和密钥（相当于家门钥匙），点「测试连接」看通不通。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手机是桥，电脑是家。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
