    "熔断": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cut off"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "熔断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "熔断 = 一键掐断某个触角的投稿通道。断开后它送不进东西，需要时随时恢复，不影响其他触角。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cutting off = one-tap shutdown of an antenna's submission channel. Once cut off it can't send anything in. Reconnect whenever you need — the other antennas are unaffected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "熔断 = 一键掐断某个触角的投稿通道。断开后它送不进东西，需要时随时恢复，不影响其他触角。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "熔断后该触角立即停止工作，任务会转移到备用触角（若有）。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once cut off, this antenna stops working immediately; its tasks move to a backup antenna if there is one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "熔断后该触角立即停止工作，任务会转移到备用触角（若有）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
