    "给一个你信任的 AI 或工具发一把「钥匙」。它能帮你把记下的东西写进巢，但读不走你的任何记忆。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Issue a key to an AI or tool you trust. It can write what it records into your Hive — but it can't read any of your memories out."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "给一个你信任的 AI 或工具发一把「钥匙」。它能帮你把记下的东西写进巢，但读不走你的任何记忆。"
