    "触角就是你信任的 AI 或工具。发一张卡给它，它能把记下的东西写进你的巢，但读不走你的任何记忆。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An antenna is an AI or tool you trust. Issue it a key and it can write what it records into your Hive — but it can't read a single memory out."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触角就是你信任的 AI 或工具。发一张卡给它，它能把记下的东西写进你的巢，但读不走你的任何记忆。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
