    "记忆蜂巢手机版，是电脑蜂巢的延伸，不是替身。帮你在外面也能随手接住念头、送回家。永不上云。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Memory Hive for mobile is an extension of the Hive on your computer, not a stand-in. It helps you catch thoughts on the go and send them home. Never to the cloud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记忆蜂巢手机版，是电脑蜂巢的延伸，不是替身。帮你在外面也能随手接住念头、送回家。永不上云。"
          }
        }
