    "连不上家，删除没成": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't reach home — the delete didn't go through"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连不上家，删除没成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "连不上家，按顺序查这几样：\n\n① 电脑开着吗？蜂巢服务在电脑里跑着吗？\n② 手机和电脑连的是不是同一个 Wi-Fi？\n③ 设置页「家连接」里的地址对不对（电脑蜂巢的局域网地址）？\n④ 密钥填对了吗？\n\n都对了还连不上，就等一会儿再点「重试连接」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't reach home — check these in order:\n\n① Is the computer on? Is the Hive service running on it?\n② Are your phone and computer on the same Wi-Fi?\n③ Is the address right in Settings · Home connection (the LAN address of the Hive on your computer)?\n④ Is the key correct?\n\nIf everything checks out and it still won't connect, wait a bit and tap Reconnect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连不上家，按顺序查这几样：\n\n① 电脑开着吗？蜂巢服务在电脑里跑着吗？\n② 手机和电脑连的是不是同一个 Wi-Fi？\n③ 设置页「家连接」里的地址对不对（电脑蜂巢的局域网地址）？\n④ 密钥填对了吗？\n\n都对了还连不上，就等一会儿再点「重试连接」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
